async function openPartsArrived(){ensureSpareStatusFullPageStyle();await hydrateAuthoritativeLists();const rows=read().filter(list=>arrivedItems(list).length);const body=rows.map((list,i)=>'<button type="button" class="v2-compact-list-row" data-list="'+esc(list.listNo)+'" onclick="zukaitV2.sparePartsMain.openPartsArrivedList(this.dataset.list)"><b class="v2-row-no">'+(i+1)+'</b><span><strong>JC '+esc(list.jobCard)+'</strong></span><span>'+esc([list.vehicle,list.model,list.year].filter(Boolean).join(' ')||'Vehicle')+'</span><span>'+arrivedItems(list).length+' arrived</span><span class="v2-row-reg">'+esc(list.registration||'—')+'</span><b class="v2-row-next">›</b></button>').join('')||'<p class="muted">No arrived parts.</p>';openSpareModal(withNav('<div class="v2-sp-status-full"><h3>📦 Parts Arrived</h3><p class="muted">Open a Job Card to view arrived parts.</p>'+body+'</div>','zukaitV2.sparePartsMain.open()'));markSparePartsModal()}
